/**
 * buildPlotScene — pure DataTable + Plot → fully-resolved PlotScene geometry.
 *
 * On an XY plot column 0 is the X axis and every remaining column is a Y data series (so
 * adding a column adds a series); the other chart kinds have builders of their own below that
 * read the table in the layout their kind needs. Series are drawn with a colourblind-safe
 * palette and a legend.
 * No DOM, no React: deterministic geometry that drives the SVG view, snapshot
 * tests, and export. Robust by construction: non-finite/null cells are
 * dropped, log scales drop non-positive points with a warning, degenerate
 * domains are padded — it never throws on real data.
 */

